---
<Layout
  title="kg to lbs — Kilograms to Pounds Converter | ComputeZap"
  description="Convert kg to lbs instantly. 1 kg = 2.20462 lbs. Free kilogram to pound converter with chart for 1–200 kg. Also shows stones and ounces."
  canonical="/kg-to-lbs"
  schema={schema}
>
<style>
