      <h2>How Many Pounds in a Kilogram?</h2>
      <p>There are <strong>2.20462 pounds in 1 kilogram</strong>. The kilogram (kg) is the SI base unit of mass, while the pound (lb) is the imperial unit used in the US and UK for body weight, gym equipment, and shipping.</p>
