    <div class="card">
      <h2>How to Convert kg to lbs</h2>
      <p>To convert kilograms to pounds, multiply the kg value by <strong>2.20462</strong>. This exact factor comes from the international pound definition: 1 pound = 0.45359237 kg exactly.</p>
