    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>When You Need kg to lbs Conversion</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Health & fitness</strong> — US gym equipment uses pounds; most of the world uses kg. Knowing both lets you track progress without confusion.</li>
        <li><strong>Shipping & logistics</strong> — international shipping invoices use kg; US carriers charge by lb. Convert to get accurate rate quotes.</li>
        <li><strong>Medical dosing</strong> — drug dosages are calculated in mg/kg body weight. Hospitals routinely convert patient weight from lbs to kg.</li>
